export const prerender = true;
const TARGET = '/gifts/bo-re/';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>已更正为「般若」｜小民艺术</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, follow" />
    <link rel="canonical" href={`https://xiaominart.com${TARGET}`} />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content={`0; url=${TARGET}`} />
    <script is:inline>location.replace('/gifts/bo-re/');</script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>这件作品的字已更正为「般若」，正在带你去 <a href={TARGET}>新页面</a>。</p>
  </body>
</html>
